      {
        "description": "The endpoint will be assessed by Hospital Anxiety and Depression Scale (HAD-S) questionnaire which will be submitted to patients. The HAD-S questionnaire has seven items each for depression and anxiety subscales. Scoring for each item ranges from zero to three, with three denoting highest anxiety or depression level. A total subscale score of \\>8 points out of a possible 21 denotes considerable symptoms of anxiety or depression.",
